%% HAND-AUTHORED — sys-05 §17 fallback selection cascade + 19 trigger codes (no sequenceDiagram in spec).
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SafetyService
    participant Redis
    participant PostgreSQL

    Note over SafetyService: trigger one of 19 codes (violence_blocked, model_timeout, budget_exceeded, ...)
    SafetyService->>Redis: GET fallback:{template_set}:{locale}:{ageBand}:{trigger_code}
    alt exact_match_miss
        Redis-->>SafetyService: miss
        SafetyService->>PostgreSQL: SELECT FROM fallback_response_templates exact
        PostgreSQL-->>SafetyService: empty
        SafetyService->>Redis: GET fallback:{template_set}:{locale}:6_8:{trigger_code}
        Redis-->>SafetyService: hit broader age
        SafetyService-->>SafetyService: use broader-age template
    else broader_age_miss
        Redis-->>SafetyService: miss
        SafetyService->>Redis: GET fallback:{template_set}:{locale}:{ageBand}:generic_safe
        Redis-->>SafetyService: hit generic safe
        SafetyService-->>SafetyService: use generic_safe template
    else generic_safe_miss
        Redis-->>SafetyService: miss
        SafetyService->>PostgreSQL: SELECT FROM fallback_response_templates generic_safe
        PostgreSQL-->>SafetyService: empty
        Note over SafetyService: hardcoded ultimate — "Let's ask a grown-up together."
        SafetyService-)SafetyService: emit conv-review for missing-fallback investigation
    else all_miss_use_hardcoded
        Redis-->>SafetyService: miss
        PostgreSQL-->>SafetyService: miss across cascade
        Note over SafetyService: emit conv_missing_policy_total counter, page P1
        SafetyService-->>SafetyService: hardcoded ultimate
    else exact_match_hit
        Redis-->>SafetyService: hit exact (template_set and locale and ageBand and trigger_code)
        SafetyService-->>SafetyService: use exact template
    end
    Note over SafetyService,PostgreSQL: hardcoded floor guarantees a response — never returns null
